OL,3,GNEWSAStolen dog reunited with owners
OL,4,Aafter a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog stolen as a 10-week-old puppy has
OL,7,Fbeen reunited with her owner, just over
OL,8,Fa year after she was taken away.
OL,10,FSpringer spaniel Breeze was out on a
OL,11,Fwalk with her owner Adam at Stratfield
OL,12,FSaye, Hampshire, in August 2025 when
OL,13,Fthe thieves struck.
OL,15,FShe was left abandoned earlier this
OL,16,Fmonth with a severe eye injury close to
OL,17,Fthe Thames Water treatment site at
OL,18,FShurlock Row in Berkshire, about 20
OL,19,Fmiles (32 km) from where she was
OL,20,Fstolen.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
